1
00:00:00,384 --> 00:00:02,884
Just... Just one thing.
We're in a great place right now.

2
00:00:03,095 --> 00:00:06,055
l don't wanna do anything
that will make stuff weird again.

3
00:00:06,265 --> 00:00:08,475
- So we won't let it get weird.
- Okay.

4
00:00:08,684 --> 00:00:11,314
Oh, just a heads up. Mm.
Since the last time you saw me naked...

5
00:00:11,520 --> 00:00:13,360
...l got a Cookie Monster tattoo.

6
00:00:13,564 --> 00:00:17,524
(Penny:)The acceptable responses when you
see it are "awesome" or nothing.

7
00:00:17,735 --> 00:00:19,485
(Leonard:)What about...

8
00:00:20,321 --> 00:00:22,031
(Leonard:)...cookies.

9
00:00:28,454 --> 00:00:32,164
Amy. Amy. Amy

10
00:00:33,959 --> 00:00:35,419
(Amy:)Seven o'clock. Right on time.

11
00:00:35,628 --> 00:00:37,878
(Sheldon:)It's not an accident.

12
00:00:38,172 --> 00:00:40,342
l waited outside your door
for 20 minutes.

13
00:00:41,342 --> 00:00:42,972
(Amy:)Well, dinner's almost ready.

14
00:00:43,177 --> 00:00:47,137
l must say I was surprised you chose to
spend our date-night in your apartment.

15
00:00:47,348 --> 00:00:48,478
Well, as I mentioned, uh...

16
00:00:48,682 --> 00:00:52,772
(Sheldon:)...the Pasadena City Council
is debating longer crosswalk times...

17
00:00:52,978 --> 00:00:56,068
(Sheldon:)...and later, the Lego store
is having a Midnight Madness sale.

